# .marcus-scrub.example — the format of the scrub registry that scripts/snapshot.sh reads.
# The real file is .marcus-scrub at the main clone's root: gitignored, never committed, never shipped.
# Copy this file to .marcus-scrub, replace every entry below with your own, delete these ones.
#
# One entry per line: a product code, a client code or a name. Matched literally, as a whole
# word, case-insensitively, at least 2 characters. Anything from # to end of line is a
# comment (ACME#old reads as ACME), blank lines are ignored.
# Do not list the owner's name: owner-name already gates it from marcus.config.json, and
# only owner-name carries the LICENSE / plugin-manifest allowlist — the registry has none.
ACME
GLBX
Globex
Initech Sample Client
